From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:59:49 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/22] System Settings: search finds settings and leads to the
 control

The search field now also matches the settings inside pages. A result shows
the text of the setting with Category > Page > Section below it. Opening one
opens the page, scrolls the control into view and frames it for a moment. It
works for QML pages (QQuickItem tree) and QtWidgets pages without a change
in the pages. Down moves to the results, Enter opens the first, Escape clears.

